<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SEVEROCESK PLYN 6YR BOND OVERSUBSCRIBED - CSOB.</title>
<headline>CZECH SEVEROCESK PLYN 6YR BOND OVERSUBSCRIBED - CSOB.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arranger Ceskoslovenska Obchodni Banka said on Wednesday it had conducted a Dutch auction of 400 million crowns in 6-year bonds for regional gas distributor Severoceska Plynarenska a.s..</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the auction was oversubscribed with the bonds priced at par and the coupon, set at auction, was 11.85 percent.</p>
</text>
